voice_function.multi_language_notes:
1. After enabling different language switches, the air conditioner will support recognition and response in the corresponding language. For example, use Cantonese to wake up 'Xiao T Xiao T', and the air conditioner will automatically switch to Cantonese for response and recognition;
2. After waking up the air conditioner in different languages, you can only continue the conversation in that language. For example, if you wake up with Cantonese, you can only use Cantonese to talk to the air conditioner, and Mandarin cannot be recognized;
3. This function takes effect after connecting to the Internet. After the air conditioner is offline, only Mandarin can be recognized;
4. Multi-language recognition is not supported during family calls.
